Freeport
========

Freeport is a modified distribution built from content and source code in
the upstream fmhy/edit repository:

    https://github.com/fmhy/edit

Copyright and Apache-2.0 notices present in upstream source files are
retained. The upstream repository does not publish a root NOTICE file; this
file records the provenance of the distribution and the changes made here.

Changes by bytepassperks include:

* Freeport branding, navigation, metadata, and visual theme.
* Build-time de-branding and narrowly scoped upstream ownership filtering.
* Freeport-owned authentication, feedback, newsletter, and administration
  Pages Functions backed by Cloudflare D1.
* Automated upstream synchronization and Cloudflare Pages deployment.
